  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "n.",
      "zh": "愿望；祝愿"
    },
    {
      "pos": "v.",
      "zh": "希望；想要；祝愿"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "My "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "wish"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " is to become a scientist when I grow up. What is yours, Betty?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我的愿望是长大后成为一名科学家。贝蒂，你的愿望是什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "wish"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " you good health and a long life."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "祝您健康长寿。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "wish 是常考单词，学生要掌握这个单词的用法，并且比较与 hope 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) wish sb. to do sth. 或 wish sb. sth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) hope to do sth. 或者后接宾语从句。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I wish you to write to me. = I hope you will write to me."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我希望你能写信给我。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
